{
 "purpose": "Payments fail at rush hours because of the mobile network, not the device. Give the peak-hour guidance from the policy section. Say no technician is needed because the device itself is fine.",
 "facts": {
  "merchant": "Sangha Beauty Parlour",
  "owner_first_name": "Rajata",
  "language": "Hindi",
  "peak_errors_per_day": 7.0,
  "offpeak_errors_per_day": 0.3
 },
 "policy_section": {
  "ref": "Retention playbook §4.2",
  "text": "Retention playbook §4.2 Network issues: Peak-hour guidance message\n\n**4.2 Peak-hour guidance message.** Send a short message in the merchant's language:\n- Where the device sits matters: near the shop front, away from metal shutters.\n- If the device has a SIM, ask whether a Wi-Fi option is available in the shop.\n- Keep the printed QR visible as a backup during rush hours.\n- Ask customers to wait for the announcement before leaving."
 }
}
